170	 * apps/api) and the application root (the pnpm workspace root), so a
171	 * shared root-level .env documented in the README and a package-specific
172	 * override both take effect consistently — instead of each process only
173	 * ever searching its own directory. Mutates the real process.env in
174	 * place: intended for a single process's own startup, where process.env
175	 * genuinely IS that process's environment. Use `resolveEffectiveEnv`
176	 * instead when two applications' environments must be computed
177	 * independently (see packages/config/src/cli.ts's `check-ports` command).
178	 */
