10	// at an ISOLATED temp fixture directory (never the real apps/web or relis/
11	// directories), so a .env file can introduce values without touching any
12	// real developer file. Node resolves "@relis/config"/"next" relative to
13	// run.mjs's own file location, not `cwd`, so this works unmodified.
