16	//  1. NODE_ENV is validated AFTER loadEnvFiles(), not only from the OS
17	//     environment before it — a .env file introducing an invalid/empty
18	//     NODE_ENV must be rejected before Next is spawned.
19	//  2. .env.test.local is loaded in test mode (matching installed Next.js
20	//     behavior), and invalid configuration originating from it is
21	//     rejected before Next is spawned.
