148	  // ".env.test.local is loaded" and ".env.local is ignored" at the loader
149	  // level are covered directly (and more cheaply) in env-loading.test.ts's
150	  // "loadEnvFiles: test-mode handling" suite. This test covers what
151	  // specifically requires the real process boundary: invalid configuration
152	  // sourced from .env.test.local must be rejected before Next is spawned.
153	  it("loads .env.test.local in test mode and rejects invalid configuration it introduces, before Next is spawned", async () => {
