 *    apps/web's wrapper, which now forwards it to its own Next child — a
 *    chance to shut down its own tree on its own), then, if the process
 *    (or any part of its tree) is still alive after `gracePeriodMs`, a
 *    forceful, platform-appropriate tree-kill (`killProcessTree`) that
 *    does not depend on cooperation at all.
