   - **Item 4 (stack/structure audit)** — not started. Will require reading `context/stack.yml` and `context/project-structure.md` fresh (or recalling from earlier in session) and systematically checking every file touched in the runtime-config task: `packages/config/*`, `packages/database/*` (including `prisma/{control,project}/`), `tooling/scripts/deploy.mjs`, `apps/web/scripts/run.mjs`, `apps/web/src/shared/lib/config.ts`, `packages/test-utils/*`, `tests/fixtures/runtime-config/*`, `tests/integration/runtime-config/*`, `.env.example`, `README.md`, various `package.json` files for dependency placement.

4. Errors and fixes:
